[689.092372, "o", "=== Variant A: convert-in-loop ===\r\nA bm128 bn128 bk64 s3 w8: 2.913 ms  (566 fp16-TFLOPS)\r\nA bm128 bn256 bk64 s3 w8: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nA bm256 bn128 bk64 s3 w8: 2.760 ms  (598 fp16-TFLOPS)\r\nA bm128 bn128 bk64 s4 w8: 3.115 ms  (529 fp16-TFLOPS)\r\nA bm128 bn256 bk32 s4 w8: 2.893 ms  (570 fp16-TFLOPS)\r\nA bm256 bn128 bk32 s4 w8: 2.742 ms  (602 fp16-TFLOPS)\r\nA bm128 bn128 bk128 s3 w8: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nA bm64 bn256 bk64 s4 w4: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nA bm128 bn256 bk64 s4 w8: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nA bm256 bn128 bk64 s4 w8: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nA bm128 bn64 bk64 s4 w4: 4.077 ms  (405 fp16-TFLOPS)\r\nA bm256 bn256 bk32 s3 w8: 41.571 ms  (40 fp16-TFLOPS)\r\nA bm128 bn256 bk128 s2 w8: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nA bm64 bn128 bk128 s4 w4: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nA bm128 bn128 bk256 s2 w8: FAIL OutOfResources\r\n=== Variant B: pre-split A ===\r\nB bm128 bn128 bk64 s3 w8: 3.350 ms (incl presplit)\r\nB bm128 bn256 bk64 s3 w8: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nB bm256 bn128 bk64 s3 w8: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nB bm128 bn128 bk64 s4 w8: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nB"]
