[937.699965, "o", "torch fp16 mm: 0.690 ms (797 TFLOPS)\r\naddmm mixed FAIL: self and mat2 must have the same dtype, but got Float and Half\r\nsplit ok: True\r\nsplit kernel: 0.185 ms\r\n=== Variant F: interleaved fp16 ===\r\nF bm128 bn128 bk64 s3 w8: 35.420 ms (incl split)\r\nF bm128 bn128 bk64 s4 w8: 34.553 ms (incl split)\r\nF bm128 bn256 bk64 s3 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, R\r\nF bm256 bn128 bk64 s3 w8: 26.137 ms (incl split)\r\nF bm128 bn256 bk32 s4 w8: 26.022 ms (incl split)\r\nF bm256 bn128 bk32 s4 w8: 24.577 ms (incl split)\r\nF bm128 bn128 bk32 s4 w8: 33.526 ms (incl split)\r\nF bm64 bn256 bk64 s4 w4: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Re\r\nF bm128 bn256 bk64 s4 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, R\r\nF bm128 bn128 bk128 s3 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, \r\nF bm128 bn256 bk128 s2 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, \r\nF bm256 bn256 bk64 s3 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, R\r\n=== F kernel-only ===\r\nFk bm128 bn1"]
