[1171.302169, "o", "seed 0: ratio 0.2009 pass True\r\nseed 5: ratio 0.2081 pass True\r\nseed 10: ratio 0.2053 pass True\r\nseed 15: ratio 0.2108 pass True\r\nworst ratio over 20 seeds: 0.23686641454696655\r\n=== 2-dot config sweep ===\r\n2d bm128 bn128 bk64 s3 w8: 3.066 ms (538 fp16-TFLOPS)\r\n2d bm128 bn128 bk64 s4 w8: 3.136 ms (526 fp16-TFLOPS)\r\n2d bm128 bn128 bk64 s5 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 294912, \r\n2d bm256 bn128 bk64 s3 w8: 2.822 ms (584 fp16-TFLOPS)\r\n2d bm128 bn256 bk64 s3 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 262144, \r\n2d bm128 bn256 bk32 s4 w8: 2.982 ms (553 fp16-TFLOPS)\r\n2d bm256 bn128 bk32 s4 w8: 2.837 ms (581 fp16-TFLOPS)\r\n2d bm128 bn128 bk32 s4 w8: 2.768 ms (596 fp16-TFLOPS)\r\n2d bm128 bn128 bk32 s5 w8: 2.972 ms (555 fp16-TFLOPS)\r\n2d bm256 bn128 bk32 s5 w8: 2.759 ms (598 fp16-TFLOPS)\r\n2d bm128 bn256 bk32 s5 w8: 2.867 ms (575 fp16-TFLOPS)\r\n2d bm256 bn256 bk32 s4 w8: 41.379 ms (40 fp16-TFLOPS)\r\n2d bm128 bn256 bk64 s4 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: sha"]
[1171.302235, "o", "red memory, Required: 360448, \r\n2d bm256 bn128 bk64 s4 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 327680, \r\n2d bm256 bn256 bk64 s3 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 327680, \r\n2d bm128 bn512 bk32 s3 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 262144, \r\n2d bm256 bn256 bk32 s3 w8: 40.984 ms (40 fp16-TFLOPS)\r\n2d bm128 bn128 bk128 s3 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 327680, \r\n2d bm256 bn128 bk128 s2 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 262144, \r\n"]
