[1266.344731, "o", "=== head-to-head, 3 reps each ===\r\nnd2 bm128 bn128 bk32 s4 w8 gm8: 2.197 ms\r\nnd2 bm128 bn128 bk64 s3 w8 gm8: 2.330 ms\r\nnd2 bm256 bn128 bk32 s4 w8 gm8: 2.098 ms\r\nnd2 bm256 bn128 bk32 s5 w8 gm8: 2.077 ms\r\nnd2 bm128 bn128 bk32 s4 w8 gm4: 2.251 ms\r\nnd2 bm128 bn128 bk32 s4 w8 gm16: 2.287 ms\r\nnd2 bm128 bn128 bk32 s4 w4 gm8: 2.516 ms\r\nnd2 bm64 bn128 bk32 s4 w4 gm8: 3.097 ms\r\nnd2 bm64 bn256 bk32 s4 w4 gm8: 2.777 ms\r\nnd2 bm128 bn128 bk32 s3 w8 gm8: 2.189 ms\r\nnd2 bm64 bn128 bk64 s4 w4 gm8: 3.088 ms\r\nnd2 bm128 bn64 bk32 s4 w4 gm8: 3.069 ms\r\nnd3 bm128 bn128 bk32 s4 w8 gm8: FAIL AssertionError: \r\nnd3 bm128 bn128 bk64 s3 w8 gm8: FAIL AssertionError: \r\nnd3 bm256 bn128 bk32 s4 w8 gm8: FAIL AssertionError: \r\nnd3 bm256 bn128 bk32 s5 w8 gm8: FAIL AssertionError: \r\nnd3 bm128 bn128 bk32 s4 w8 gm4: FAIL AssertionError: \r\nnd3 bm128 bn128 bk32 s4 w8 gm16: FAIL AssertionError: \r\nnd3 bm128 bn128 bk32 s4 w4 gm8: FAIL AssertionError: \r\nnd3 bm64 bn128 bk32 s4 w4 gm8: FAIL AssertionError: \r\nnd3 bm64 bn256 bk32 s4 w4 gm8: FAIL AssertionErr"]
