[1454.243629, "o", "=== TMA 2-dot ===\r\nTMA bm128 bn128 bk64 s3 w8: 3.156 ms\r\nTMA bm128 bn128 bk64 s4 w8: 3.258 ms\r\nTMA bm128 bn256 bk64 s3 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 262192, \r\nTMA bm256 bn128 bk64 s3 w8: 3.081 ms\r\nTMA bm128 bn128 bk32 s4 w8: 2.652 ms\r\nTMA bm256 bn128 bk32 s4 w8: 3.171 ms\r\nTMA bm128 bn256 bk32 s4 w8: 2.783 ms\r\nTMA bm128 bn256 bk64 s4 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 360504, \r\nTMA bm256 bn128 bk64 s4 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 327736, \r\nTMA bm128 bn128 bk128 s3 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 327728, \r\nTMA bm128 bn256 bk128 s3 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 524336, \r\nTMA bm256 bn256 bk64 s3 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 327728, \r\nTMA bm128 bn512 bk64 s3 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 458800, \r\nTMA bm256 bn256 bk128 s2 w8: FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: s"]
